{"steam_appid":4369130,"steam_name":"Chop Chop Inc.","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4369130/1969735619/9832fa4f8eea77795600091bfe9e408b4703587b/1786096186/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786102299","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257393577/d4836285a8b335dd92e077cf5a7b6989f17ed086/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786102299","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/667fb8071e628eabc4d01830b0bafe638e5bce67/ss_667fb8071e628eabc4d01830b0bafe638e5bce67.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786432849","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/ef4be71259c9ff7542440163fd1dde8683c128b4/ss_ef4be71259c9ff7542440163fd1dde8683c128b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786432849","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/93f326a95d77302fbe3f5c68154614bcbb46eb94/ss_93f326a95d77302fbe3f5c68154614bcbb46eb94.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786432849","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/22c6e206feb460dea332367e6035563aaf1ca2ce/ss_22c6e206feb460dea332367e6035563aaf1ca2ce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786432849","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/d1b941961a2bf3f9401ac2a177a96a995902e7ad/ss_d1b941961a2bf3f9401ac2a177a96a995902e7ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786432849"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cut, Process, Craft, Distribute</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/0f948e276bdf13b989ca66bc4475e203.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/0f948e276bdf13b989ca66bc4475e203.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/0f948e276bdf13b989ca66bc4475e203.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>You got fired from Furnox Corp 🖕.</strong><br><strong> Now you start over with nothing but an axe, a few trees and revenge on your mind </strong>(╯‵□′)╯︵┻━┻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop down trees, turn logs into planks, craft furniture and sell it for profit. Reinvest your money into better tools, new machines and faster production. What begins as manual labor grows into optimized production lines and high value furniture sets that grant bonus payouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas, discover new tree types, expand your operation step by step and improve your character with strength and stamina upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌳 Cut down trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/48df05aa3a31f5f169001a99e6676444.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/48df05aa3a31f5f169001a99e6676444.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/48df05aa3a31f5f169001a99e6676444.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trees of all shapes, sizes, colors and questionable physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it stands upright and looks even remotely choppable, congratulations: It’s firewood now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪵  Collect &amp; process resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a4a9851b42877fa18dea762844cfa4b6.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a4a9851b42877fa18dea762844cfa4b6.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a4a9851b42877fa18dea762844cfa4b6.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn raw nature into refined building materials using machines that absolutely should not be left unattended.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logs become planks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planks become furniture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furniture becomes profit. 💰</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔨 Craft like a maniac</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/594083c02041f7769ce9446e96593332.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/594083c02041f7769ce9446e96593332.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/594083c02041f7769ce9446e96593332.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Create furniture, props and tools, including deeply unnecessary but deeply impressive designs like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wooden PC (Wood has excellent thermal properties... right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wooden weight bench (Splinters only make you stronger!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it exists ... you can probably make it out of wood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚚 Distribute</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3d08971f852519ac38a63dbaf67dac03.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3d08971f852519ac38a63dbaf67dac03.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3d08971f852519ac38a63dbaf67dac03.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load up your handcrafted chaos and ship it to the nearby city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money.<br>Reach new customers.<br>Confuse absolutely everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛒 Buy components</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e27cf61fbbea83fb95fe9a9104fc2dd8.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e27cf61fbbea83fb95fe9a9104fc2dd8.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e27cf61fbbea83fb95fe9a9104fc2dd8.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't chop it? Can’t craft it?<br>Buy it!<br>Use bought components to level up your character or jam them into your creations like a true artisan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 <strong>Start your business!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/96b5a19a662995ee5c08498b09240a42.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/96b5a19a662995ee5c08498b09240a42.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/96b5a19a662995ee5c08498b09240a42.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin with nothing but ambition and poor financial decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your headquarters and expand into a world packed with secrets, resources and questionable business ethics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🦆 Meet wacky characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/fcd92b9f0737cefd60dda2d06702d26f.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky personalities, help them, befriend them and integrate them into your production chain <br>... completely voluntarily, of course ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ Warning:<br>The ducks are up to something! <strong>🦆</strong><br>They know ...<br>You know they know ...🔪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪑 Master furniture crafting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/e4fc7eda0fbee52403e2a4ae9bc3dda3.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an ever-growing catalog of furniture using blueprints, rare materials and raw creative chaos. <br>Minimalism is optional. Overengineering is encouraged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏗️ Leave a mark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/f1c7e05e1c751a73535f71a04bcb67c0.poster.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/f1c7e05e1c751a73535f71a04bcb67c0.webm?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/f1c7e05e1c751a73535f71a04bcb67c0.mp4?t=1786432849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the nearby city to unlock new customers, missions, secrets, and character upgrades.<br>Urban development has never involved this much ... wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💎 Unique trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/a6819e3a7a4a95373d6e08da96fae405.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stone trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Electric trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody knows why they exist. <br>Your axe doesn’t care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their mysterious origins as you progress ... or just chop first and ask questions later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>💪 Character stats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/b2bb0a7c3c4023c03df5f7a9f59f3981.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your character by interacting with the world and using exercise equipment.<br>Yes, you can bench press your way to better woodworking.<br>No, we will not explain the science.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️ Powerful upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/bf5278e7bdc7c94ea1b1235d3277e377.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New machines.<br>Better axes.<br>&quot;Smarter&quot; distribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation that makes your empire run smoother than a freshly sanded plank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🍲 Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/53593eb70688aa1402c43f17d1a3a379.avif?t=1786432849\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn resources into delicious meals that boost your stats.<br>Because nothing fuels industrial-scale lumber destruction like a hearty stew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4369130/extras/3bdfbbe4ca7751f84572cc200bfa711c.webp?t=1786432849\" width=616 height=1 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-6700 or Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1070 Ti or Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. Supports monitors with 16:10 and wider aspect ratios (NOTE: 5:4 and 4:3 aspect ratios are not supported) | Additional disk space is needed for savegame storage</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-11600K or Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3080 Ti or Radeon RX 6800 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. Supports monitors with 16:10 and wider aspect ratios (NOTE: 5:4 and 4:3 aspect ratios are not supported) | Additional disk space is needed for savegame storage</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["NullRef Entertainment"],"publishers":["rokaplay select"],"release_date":"7 Aug, 2026"}